1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,670
Salama, somon pu tela! Cu pi solu ti pun tan ko palayu pen seyon sa sewanu.
Greetings, people of Earth! Today we're talking about the stars and the universe.

2
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:09,720
Ta ka kono kowa kan pen seyon. Cu seyo ka sama co?
I know absolutely nothing about stars. So what is a star?

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:17,770
Seyo ka sama pilo tawama pi sela suma. Cu pi kole pu to pun seyo ka tali cun atom cun tawano pa cun atom cun tawamo.
A star is a gigantic fire in the night sky. Deep in its heart, the star fuses small atoms into bigger atoms.

4
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:21,260
Cu cun atom cun tawamo ke pelo pa tolo co?
So where did those bigger atoms go?

5
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:32,510
Pi so seyo tawa ke tana pun to ke pelema, sa cun atom cun ke pelo pa sewanu. Cu pelu pu suyu piloni pu tu ke kome pe seyo! Cu tan sewa ka sama seyonan. Cu ku pena pen to!
When a big star died, it exploded, and its atoms flew out into the universe. The iron in your blood came from a star! We are all made of star pieces. Think about that!

6
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:38,880
Cowi! Cu ta ka sama seyo! Cu ta ke kono to pume. Cu pune sumani ka sama co?
Whoa! So I'm a star! I knew it all along. And what's a black hole?

7
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:46,130
Pi so seyo tawama ka tana pun to ki sama pune sumani. Cu pole puma pu to ka tawama, sa kolo ka ce pole pelo pe to.
When a giant star dies, it can become a black hole. Its gravity is so enormous that not even light can escape it.

8
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:49,860
Ca pune sumani ki tuma ta? Cu ta ka kowe!
Could a black hole grab me? I'm scared!

9
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:58,710
Ka ce, sawi. Cu to ka tayoma pe tan. Cu pole puma ka kuluya tolo, sa kolo ka tiye tolo kuluyo.
No, my friend. It's very far from us. Gravity bends space itself, and light follows that bent space.

10
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,560
Ta ke pena so kolo ka pelo pi tali sola!
I thought light only travels in a straight line!

11
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:12,090
Cu sewanu ka tawale! Cu pi so tu ka sile seyo tayo pun tu ka sile kolo so co ke pelo kulu kolo ken kan kan kan. Cu tu ka sile temo pume!
And the universe is expanding! When you look at a distant star, you see light that traveled a thousand light-years. You are looking into the past!

12
00:01:12,190 --> 00:01:18,380
Sewanu ka tawale, sa tanu pu ta ka tawale tuye, pan kula pulu! Tane, sawi!
The universe is expanding, and so is my waistline, thanks to all the food! Thanks, friend!

